                                <layout><p>The text is centered in the middle of the column and takes up almost all of the face of the column, with a larger gap between line eight and nine than the other lines. There is significant wearing making the top lines difficut to decipher, progressively getting better until line 8 which is almost entirely undamaged.</p>
